<title>USA: Guangdong Enterprises(Holdings)sets $500 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Enterprises(Holdings)sets $500 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Guangdong Enterprises (Holdings) Ltd was priced in the 144A private placement market on Thursday via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER GUANGDONG ENTERPRISES (HOLDINGS) LTD</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 5/22/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.85   FIRST PAY DATE 11/22/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 8.89 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD +223 BPS   CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
